# 🎙️ Multimodal AI Technical Support Agent

A real-time, voice-enabled AI support agent designed to deliver intelligent, interactive, and human-like technical assistance through a unified multimodal interface. The system combines conversational AI, live voice interaction, an expressive 3D avatar, screen sharing, and real-world action execution to create a next-generation technical support experience.

### ✨ Core Capabilities

- 🎙️ **Real-Time Voice Interaction** — Natural voice-based communication between users and the AI support agent.
- 💬 **Conversational AI** — Context-aware text and voice conversations for intelligent technical assistance.
- 🤖 **3D AI Avatar** — Human-like visual presence powered by Beyond Presence for a more immersive support experience.
- 🖥️ **Live Screen Sharing** — Enables the agent to observe the user's screen and understand software, UI, and desktop-related issues.
- 👁️ **Multimodal Understanding** — Combines conversational input with visual screen context for more effective troubleshooting.
- ⚡ **Real-Time Agent Interaction** — Low-latency communication and responsive AI assistance powered by LiveKit Agents.
- 🛠️ **Action-Oriented Support** — Designed to execute real-world support actions such as unblocking users, initiating workflows, and sending support-ticket emails.
- 🔊 **Audio Feedback** — Typing sounds, voice responses, and success cues for an interactive user experience.
- 🎨 **Customizable Interface** — Configurable visual appearance and interaction experience.
- 🔐 **Human-Centered Support** — Designed to make technical assistance more accessible, interactive, and efficient.

